"时，从"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}=0.9m"},{"type":"text","value":"释放时，根据动能定理可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mgh-\\mu mgs_{2}=0"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"s_{2}=1.8m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可知物块达到距离"},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":"点0.8m处静止，滑块a由E点速度为零，返回到"},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":"时，根据动能定理可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mgH-\\mu mgs_{3}=0"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"s_{3}=0.4m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n距离"},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":"点0.6m，综上可知当"},{"type":"math","value":"0.9m<h<1.2m"},{"type":"text","value":"时\n"},{"type":"math","value":"3l-s_{3}\\le x\\le 3l"},{"type":"text","value":"\n代入数据得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"2.6m\\le x\\le 3m"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202206-q21","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202206","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202206-q21","number":"21","order":21,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"75b5e36ba20206c0dc8f7ba59f6e4a9a6b4087c0806c7ed653edf73830b9fc80","body":[{"type":"text","value":"舰载机电磁弹射是现在航母最先进的弹射技术，我国在这一领域已达到世界先进水平。某兴趣小组开展电磁弹射系统的设计研究，如图1所示，用于推动模型飞机的动子（图中未画出）与线圈绝缘并固定，线圈带动动子，可在水平导轨上无摩擦滑动。线圈位于导轨间的辐向磁场中，其所在处的磁感应强度大小均为B。开关S与1接通，恒流源与线圈连接，动子从静止开始推动飞机加速，飞机达到起飞速度时与动子脱离；此时S掷向2接通定值电阻"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，同时施加回撤力F，在F和磁场力作用下，动子恰好返回初始位置停下。若动子从静止开始至返回过程的v-t图如图2所示，在"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"至"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"时间内F=(800-10v）N，"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"时撤去F。已知起飞速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"=80m/s，"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"=1.5s，线圈匝数n=100匝，每匝周长l=1m，飞机的质量M=10kg，动子和线圈的总质量m=5kg，"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"=9.5Ω，B=0.1T，不计空气阻力和飞机起飞对动子运动速度的影响，求\n（1）恒流源的电流I；\n（2）线圈电阻R； \n（3）时刻"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/da9506b1620d9987e19a6a3a1a6d1ed312ee8e2410a59e12042f1de55df9bac3.png","width":4111,"height":1285,"width_mm":145.52,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202206-q21-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】（1）80A；（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"R=0.5\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"；（3）"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{3}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}+3}{2}s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n【详解】（1）由题意可知接通恒流源时安培力\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{安}}=nBIl"},{"type":"text","value":"\n动子和线圈在0~"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"时间段内做匀加速直线运动，运动的加速度为\n"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{v_{1}}{t_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据牛顿第二定律有\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{安}}=\\left( M+m \\right)a"},{"type":"text","value":"\n代入数据联立解得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{\\left( m+M \\right)v_{1}}{nlBt_{1}}=80A"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）当S掷向2接通定值电阻"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，感应电流为\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I'=\\frac{nBlv}{R_{0}+R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n此时安培力为\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F'_{\\text{安}}=nBI'l"},{"type":"text","value":"\n所以此时根据牛顿第二定律有\n"},{"type":"math","value":"(800-10v)+\\frac{n^{2}l^{2}B^{2}}{R_{0}+R}v=ma'"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由图可知在"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"至"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"期间加速度恒定，则有\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{n^{2}l^{2}B^{2}}{R_{0}+R}=10"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"R=0.5\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"a'=160m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（3）根据图像可知\n"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}-t_{1}=\\frac{v_{1}}{a'}=0.5s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n故"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}=2s"},{"type":"text","value":"；在0~"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"时间段内的位移\n"},{"type":"math","value":"s=\\frac{1}{2}v_{1}t_{2}=80m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n而根据法拉第电磁感应定律有\n"},{"type":"math","value":"E=n\\frac{\\Delta \\phi}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{nB\\Delta S}{\\Delta t}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n电荷量的定义式\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta q=It"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{E}{R+R_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta q=\\frac{nBl\\left[ s-\\frac{1}{2}a'\\left(t_{3}-t_{2}\\right)^{2} \\right]}{R+R_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n从"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"时刻到最后返回初始位置停下的时间段内通过回路的电荷量，根据动量定理有\n"},{"type":"math","value":"-nBl\\Delta q=0-ma'\\left( t_{3}-t_{2} \\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"\n联立可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\left( t_{3}-t_{2} \\right)^{2}+\\left( t_{3}-t_{2} \\right)-1=0"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{3}=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}+3}{2}s"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202206-q22","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202206","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202206-q22","number":"22","order":22,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a74fe3deba1fbc545cbed4bcab26deb140c576e5c577e24e7df3f690e32445c7","body":[{"type":"text","value":"离子速度分析器截面图如图所示。半径为R的空心转筒P，可绕过O点、垂直xOy平面（纸面）的中心轴逆时针匀速转动（角速度大小可调），其上有一小孔S。整个转筒内部存在方向垂直纸面向里的匀强磁场。转筒下方有一与其共轴的半圆柱面探测板Q，板Q与y轴交于A点。离子源M能沿着x轴射出质量为m、电荷量为 – q（q > 0）、速度大小不同的离子，其中速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"的离子进入转筒，经磁场偏转后恰好沿y轴负方向离开磁场。落在接地的筒壁或探测板上的离子被吸收且失去所带电荷，不计离子的重力和离子间的相互作用。\n（1）①求磁感应强度B的大小；\n②若速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"的离子能打在Q板的A处，求转筒P角速度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega"},{"type":"text","value":"的大小；\n（2）较长时间后，转筒P每转一周有N个离子打在板Q的C处，OC与x轴负方向的夹角为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"，求转筒转动一周的时间内，C处受到平均冲力F的大小；\n（3）若转筒P的角速度小于"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{6v_{0}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，且A处探测到离子，求板Q上能探测到离子的其他"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"'的值（为探测点位置和O点连线与x轴负方向的夹角）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6555dbd212061e08ed0f81572f7a4f07dd49be7eebad8ed7d37deee53298