}"},{"type":"text","value":"，n = 0，1，2，…\n（3）转筒的转动角速度\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{(4k+1)v_{0}}{R}=\\frac{\\left( 2n\\pi +\\theta' \\right)v_{0}}{\\left(\\pi -\\theta'\\right)R}<\\frac{6v_{0}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n其中\nk = 1，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta'=\\frac{5-2n}{6}\\pi"},{"type":"text","value":"，n = 0，2\n可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta'=\\frac{5}{6}\\pi"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{6}\\pi"}]}}]}
